---
// Strudel 極簡播放器：歌單式切歌、只輸出聲音、播放時顯示聲波動畫
import { SONGS } from '../data/songs';
---

<div class="strudel-player retro-border retro-shadow bg-[var(--bg)] p-6 my-12">
  <!-- 標題 -->
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-barcode tracking-wider">NOW PLAYING</h2>
    <div class="text-xs font-mono opacity-70">STRUDEL AUDIO</div>
  </div>

  <!-- 播放器主體 -->
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_200px] gap-6">
    <!-- 歌曲資訊與控制 -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-mono opacity-70 mb-1">CURRENT TRACK</p>
        <p id="current-song-title" class="text-xl font-bold acid-chroma">
          {SONGS[0]?.title ?? 'No song loaded'}
        </p>
        <p id="current-song-desc" class="text-sm mt-2 opacity-80">
          {SONGS[0]?.description ?? ''}
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 播放時聲波 -->
      <div id="play-waveform" class="waveform hidden h-12">
        {Array.from({ length: 20 }).map((_, i) => (
          <div
            class="waveform-bar"
            style={`animation-delay: ${(i * 0.05).toFixed(2)}s; height: ${Math.max(4, Math.random() * 40)}px;`}
          />
        ))}
      </div>

      <!-- 控制按鈕 -->
      <div class="flex gap-3">
        <button id="btn-play" class="btn-retro flex-1">
          <span class="play-icon">▶</span>
          <span class="stop-icon hidden">■</span>
          <span id="btn-play-text">PLAY</span>
        </button>
        <button id="btn-stop" class="btn-retro px-6">STOP</button>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xs font-mono opacity-60">
        * 播放音訊需點擊按鈕啟動（瀏覽器 autoplay 政策）
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 歌單 -->
    <div class="border-l-3 border-[var(--fg)] pl-4">
      <p class="text-sm font-mono opacity-70 mb-3">TRACK LIST</p>
      <ul id="song-list" class="space-y-2">
        {SONGS.map((song) => (
          <li>
            <button
              class="song-item w-full text-left px-3 py-2 border-2 border-[var(--fg)] bg-[var(--bg)] hover:bg-[var(--fg)] hover:text-[var(--bg)] transition-colors font-mono text-sm"
              data-song-id={song.id}
            >
              {song.title}
            </button>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  import { SONGS } from '../data/songs';

  let strudelReady = false;
  let currentSongId: string | null = null;
  let isPlaying = false;

  const playBtn = document.getElementById('btn-play');
  const stopBtn = document.getElementById('btn-stop');
  const playIcon = playBtn?.querySelector('.play-icon');
  const stopIcon = playBtn?.querySelector('.stop-icon');
  const playText = document.getElementById('btn-play-text');
  const waveform = document.getElementById('play-waveform');
  const currentTitle = document.getElementById('current-song-title');
  const currentDesc = document.getElementById('current-song-desc');
  const songItems = document.querySelectorAll('.song-item');

  // 動態載入 Strudel
  async function initStrudel() {
    if (strudelReady) return;
    try {
      // @ts-ignore
      await import('https://unpkg.com/@strudel/web@1.0.3');
      // @ts-ignore
      await window.initStrudel();
      strudelReady = true;
    } catch (err) {
      console.error('Strudel 載入失敗：', err);
      if (currentTitle) currentTitle.textContent = '音訊載入失敗，請稍後再試';
    }
  }

  function updateUI(songId: string | null, playing: boolean) {
    const song = SONGS.find((s) => s.id === songId);
    if (song) {
      if (currentTitle) currentTitle.textContent = song.title;
      if (currentDesc) currentDesc.textContent = song.description || '';
    }
    // 更新歌單高亮
    songItems.forEach((item) => {
      const el = item as HTMLElement;
      const active = el.dataset.songId === songId;
      el.style.background = active ? 'var(--fg)' : 'var(--bg)';
      el.style.color = active ? 'var(--bg)' : 'var(--fg)';
    });
    // 更新播放按鈕
    if (playIcon && stopIcon && playText) {
      if (playing) {
        playIcon.classList.add('hidden');
        stopIcon.classList.remove('hidden');
        playText.textContent = 'PLAYING';
        waveform?.classList.remove('hidden');
      } else {
        playIcon.classList.remove('hidden');
        stopIcon.classList.add('hidden');
        playText.textContent = 'PLAY';
        waveform?.classList.add('hidden');
      }
    }
  }

  async function playSong(songId: string) {
    await initStrudel();
    if (!strudelReady) return;

    const song = SONGS.find((s) => s.id === songId);
    if (!song) return;

    // 停止前一首
    if (isPlaying) {
      // @ts-ignore
      window.hush();
      isPlaying = false;
    }

    currentSongId = songId;
    isPlaying = true;
    updateUI(songId, true);

    try {
      // @ts-ignore
      const code = song.code;
      // @ts-ignore
      if (typeof window.evaluate === 'function') {
        // @ts-ignore
        await window.evaluate(code);
      } else {
        // fallback: 使用 Function constructor 避免直接 eval
        // @ts-ignore
        const pattern = new Function(`return (${code})`)();
        // @ts-ignore
        pattern.play();
      }
    } catch (err) {
      console.error('播放失敗：', err);
      if (currentTitle) currentTitle.textContent = '播放失敗';
      isPlaying = false;
      updateUI(songId, false);
    }
  }

  function stopPlayback() {
    if (!strudelReady) return;
    // @ts-ignore
    window.hush();
    isPlaying = false;
    updateUI(currentSongId, false);
  }

  // 事件綁定
  playBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (isPlaying) {
      stopPlayback();
    } else if (currentSongId) {
      playSong(currentSongId);
    } else if (SONGS.length > 0) {
      playSong(SONGS[0].id);
    }
  });

  stopBtn?.addEventListener('click', stopPlayback);

  songItems.forEach((item) => {
    item.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const songId = (item as HTMLElement).dataset.songId;
      if (songId) playSong(songId);
    });
  });

  // 初始化第一首
  if (SONGS.length > 0) {
    updateUI(SONGS[0].id, false);
  }
</script>
